<h2>Final Tips on How to Use an Under Desk Elliptical</h2>
<p>Set it up once, properly: a stable chair, a mat, the right distance and low resistance. Then ease in with short sessions and build up over a week. That approach avoids the soreness and frustration that make people give up early.</p>
